  "description": "Tamp CommandPlan wrapper for Rushstack Heft 1.x, the build orchestrator behind SharePoint Framework 1.22+ and Rush monorepos. Typed build / test / clean / run verbs plus rig-defined phase actions (e.g. package-solution). Resolves the project's own pinned Heft and runs it as `node <heft bin>`, never through a .cmd shim and never by downloading it.",
